# Presentation Ontology — Display Modalities, Form Factors, Accessibility, i18n, Hardware
# Authoring form (N3) — compiled to presentation.cbor (CBOR-LD) for runtime
#
# Copyright (c) 2026 Timothy Charles Holborn. All rights reserved.
# Principal / inventor: Timothy Charles Holborn <timothy.holborn@gmail.com>
